e the peaceful mountain village of Gokayama. Discover their unique homes that have been built without the use of nails and their sloped thatched roofs.<\/li><li>Kanazawa: Learn about the delicacy of the 16th-century craft gold leaf painting with your Local Specialist.<\/li><li>Kanazawa: Enjoy a stroll through Omicho market before making your way to the beautiful Gardens of Kenrokuen which have been shaped over the past one hundred years.<\/li><li>Kyoto: Admire the beautiful golden pavilion of Kinkakuji Temple.<\/li><li>Kyoto: Your city tour takes you to the orange gates of the Fushimi Inari Shrine. Admire this sacred site before visiting Sanjeusangen-do-Hall, where you can view the 1,001 \"thousand-handed\" goddesses of mercy statues. Continue your exploration of Kyoto with a walking tour through the Gion district.<\/li><li>Gokayama: Help support a local business with a visit to a washi paper workshop. You'll watch the family at work and test your paper-making skills for yourself. Your experience directly supports United Nations Sustainable Development Goal 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities.<\/li><li>Explore Tokyo and Kyoto<\/li><li>Visit the Sensoji Temple, the Skytree Observation Tower, the Edo Tokyo Museum in Tokyo, Mt. Fuji 5th Station, the Kinkakuji Temple and Fushimi Inari Shrine and Sanjusangen-do Hall in Kyoto<\/li><li>See the traditional Gassho-zukuri houses in Gokayama and the beautiful gardens of Kenrokuen in Kanazawa<\/li><li>View Mt. Fuji<\/li><li>An expert Travel Director and professional Driver<\/li><li>Cherry-picked hotels, all tried and trusted<\/li><li>All porterage and restaurant gratuities<\/li><li>All hotel tips, charges and local taxes<\/li><li>Breakfast daily and up to half of your evening meals<\/li><li>Must-see sightseeing and surprise extras<\/li><li>Audio headsets for flexible sightseeing<\/li><li>Optional Experiences and free time<\/li><li>On occasion, hotels of similar standard and location may be utilised.<\/li><\/ul>","is_included":true}],"transport":[{"description":"<ul><li>Luxury air-conditioned coach with Wi-Fi in most countries or alternative transportation (such as rail journeys)<\/li><\/ul>","is_included":true,"ships":[]}],"accommodation":[{"description":"<ul><li>New Otani Garden Tower<\/li><li>Fuji Marriott Yamanakako<\/li><li>Associa Takayama Resort<\/li><li>Kanazawa Tokyu<\/li><li>The Hotel Higashiyama<\/li><\/ul>","is_included":true,"accommodations":[{"type":"hotel","nights":null}],"ship_rooms":[]}]}},{"adults":1,"children":0,"infants":0,"total_adults":5025,"total_children":1440,"total_infants":372,"subtotal":14274.529999999999,"tax":0,"total":14274.529999999999}],"duration":7179,"memory":46.5,"hostname":"3b7cd82e3913"}, 2025-02-25 05:19:27, ?, request, 9e4b4293-adab-4a7f-a545-2e72d4387085)) {"exception":"[object] (Illuminate\\Database\\QueryException(code: HY000): SQLSTATE[HY000]: General error: 1114 The table 'telescope_entries' is full (Connection: mysql, SQL: insert into `telescope_entries` (`batch_id`, `content`, `created_at`, `family_hash`, `type`, `uuid`) values (9e4b4293-ae18-44f7-a5f7-715fb045944c, {\"type\":\"missed\",\"key\":\"8a5da52ed126447d359e70c05721a8aa\",\"hostname\":\"3b7cd82e3913\"}, 2025-02-25 05:19:20, ?, cache, 9e4b4289-24e3-4d0d-a7dc-5b2b739788d6), (9e4b4293-ae18-44f7-a5f7-715fb045944c, {\"connection\":\"mysql\",\"bindings\":[],\"sql\":\"select * from `orders` where `orders`.`booking_id` = '124570' limit 1\",\"time\":\"474.70\",\"slow\":true,\"file\":\"\\/var\\/www\\/html\\/app\\/Filters\\/ToursFilters.php\",\"line\":432,\"hash\":\"bb8296baab8a92d3e7b4a2e10a329815\",\"hostname\":\"3b7cd82e3913\"}, 2025-02-25 05:19:21, ?, query, 9e4b428b-189f-4251-bcb9-0b0ab332898a), (9e4b4293-ae18-44f7-a5f7-715fb045944c, {\"action\":\"retrieved\",\"model\":\"App\\\\Models\\\\Order\",\"count\":1,\"hostname\":\"3b7cd82e3913\"}, 2025-02-25 05:19:21, ?, model, 9e4b428b-18b5-4145-8634-efaa8892212a), (9e4b4293-ae18-44f7-a5f7-715fb045944c, {\"connection\":\"mysql\",\"bindings\":[],