ed landmarks and gain insight into how this modern city preserves its ancient roots.<\\/li><li>Tokyo: Visit the Tokyo National Museum to browse collections of Japanese art and archaeological objects.<\\/li><li>Mt Fuji: Start your day by visiting the small rural village of Oshino Hakkai which is home to eight natural spring water ponds. Next on your travels is a 2,300-meter winding road to Mt. Fuji 5th Station. To end your day, you will ride up to Mt. Tenjo by ropeway and bask in the breath-taking views.<\\/li><li>Gokayama: Take some time to admire the peaceful mountain village of Gokayama. Discover their unique homes that have been built without the use of nails and their sloped thatched roofs.<\\/li><li>Kanazawa: Learn about the delicacy of the 16th-century craft gold leaf painting with your Local Specialist.<\\/li><li>Kanazawa: Enjoy a stroll through Omicho market before making your way to the beautiful Gardens of Kenrokuen which have been shaped over the past one hundred years.<\\/li><li>Kyoto: Admire the beautiful golden pavilion of Kinkakuji Temple.<\\/li><li>Kyoto: Your city tour takes you to the orange gates of the Fushimi Inari Shrine. Admire this sacred site before visiting Sanjeusangen-do-Hall, where you can view the 1,001 \\\"thousand-handed\\\" goddesses of mercy statues. Continue your exploration of Kyoto with a walking tour through the Gion district.<\\/li><li>Gokayama: Help support a local business with a visit to a washi paper workshop. You'll watch the family at work and test your paper-making skills for yourself. Your experience directly supports United Nations Sustainable Development Goal 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities.<\\/li><li>Explore Tokyo and Kyoto<\\/li><li>Visit the Sensoji Temple, the Skytree Observation Tower, the Edo Tokyo Museum in Tokyo, Mt. Fuji 5th Station, the Kinkakuji Temple and Fushimi Inari Shrine and Sanjusangen-do Hall in Kyoto<\\/li><li>See the traditional Gassho-zukuri houses in Gokayama and the beautiful gardens of Kenrokuen in Kanazawa<\\/li><li>View Mt. Fuji<\\/li><li>An expert Travel Director and professional Driver<\\/li><li>Cherry-picked hotels, all tried and trusted<\\/li><li>All porterage and restaurant gratuities<\\/li><li>All hotel tips, charges and local taxes<\\/li><li>Breakfast daily and up to half of your evening meals<\\/li><li>Must-see sightseeing and surprise extras<\\/li><li>Audio headsets for flexible sightseeing<\\/li><li>Optional Experiences and free time<\\/li><li>On occasion, hotels of similar standard and location may be utilised.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"is_included\":true}],\"transport\":[{\"description\":\"<ul><li>Luxury air-conditioned coach with Wi-Fi in most countries or alternative transportation (such as rail journeys)<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"is_included\":true,\"ships\":[]}],\"accommodation\":[{\"description\":\"<ul><li>New Otani Garden Tower<\\/li><li>Fuji Marriott Yamanakako<\\/li><li>Associa Takayama Resort<\\/li><li>Kanazawa Tokyu<\\/li><li>The Hotel Higashiyama<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"is_included\":true,\"accommodations\":[{\"type\":\"hotel\",\"nights\":null}],\"ship_rooms\":[]}]}},{\"adults\":1,\"children\":0,\"infants\":0,\"total_adults\":5025,\"total_children\":1440,\"total_infants\":372,\"subtotal\":14274.529999999999,\"tax\":0,\"total\":14274.529999999999}],\"duration\":7179,\"memory\":46.5,\"hostname\":\"3b7cd82e3913\"}, 2025-02-25 05:19:27, ?, request, 9e4b4293-adab-4a7f-a545-2e72d4387085)) at /var/www/html/vendor/laravel/framework/src/Illuminate/Database/Connection.php:825)
