               <\/td>\r\n                            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/table>\r\n        <br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n        <br>\r\n       <div style=3D\"text-align: center\">\r\n        <div>\r\n            <a href=3D\"https:\/\/vibeadventures.be\/api\/boooking-summary-pdf?t=\r\nour_id=3D124570\" style=3D\"background-color: orange; padding:2%;color:white;=\r\nborder-radius:10px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration: none;\">View booking<\/a=\r\n>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <br>\r\n        <div>\r\n            <label>If you need help, <a style=3D\"color:#82CF45;text-decorat=\r\nion:none;\" href=3D\"https:\/\/hopeful-nobel.74-208-189-166.plesk.page\/contact-=\r\nus\" >contact us<\/a><\/label>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n       <br>\r\n       <div style=3D\"text-align: justify; border-style: dotted; padding:2%;=\r\n border-radius:15px;border-color:#82CF45\">\r\n\r\n                      <div style=3D\"page-break-inside: avoid\">\r\n            <p style=3D\"color: gray\"> <b>FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS<\/b> <\/p=\r\n>\r\n               <p><b>How do i check in for my flight?<\/b><\/p>\r\n               <p>You can check in online through the airline's website or =\r\nat the airport check-in counter. Make sure to download your e-ticket and co=\r\nmplete the process well in advance.<\/p>\r\n           <\/div>\r\n           <div style=3D\"page-break-inside: avoid\">\r\n               <p><b>Where can i find baggage and check-in policies?<\/b><\/p=\r\n>\r\n               <p>Review the conditions outlined by each airline carrier in=\r\n your flight summary before your trip. <\/p>\r\n           <\/div>\r\n           <div style=3D\"page-break-inside: avoid\">\r\n               <p><b>Are the accommodations guarented as listed in the tour=\r\n description or trip notes?<\/b><\/p>\r\n               <p>Accommodations are approximate and subject to change base=\r\nd on availability, group size, and other factors. if changes occour, a simi=\r\nlar category accommodation will be provided <\/p>\r\n           <\/div>\r\n           <div style=3D\"page-break-inside: avoid\">\r\n               <p><b>Will need to pay any additional fees for accommodation=\r\ns?<\/b><\/p>\r\n               <p>In some locations, travelers may need to payy a municipal=\r\n tax directly to hotels upon arrival. <\/p>\r\n           <\/div>\r\n           <div style=3D\"page-break-inside: avoid\">\r\n               <p><b>What happens if the weather impacts my scheduled activ=\r\nities?<\/b><\/p>\r\n               <p>In case of unfavorable weather or other valid reasons, th=\r\ne sequence and duration of activities may be modifued or canceled without p=\r\nrior notice.<\/p>\r\n           <\/div>\r\n                  <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <br>\r\n    <div>\r\n        <table width=3D\"100%\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n                <td>\r\n                    <h2>Adventure summary<\/h2>\r\n                <\/td>\r\n                <td style=3D\"text-align: right;\">\r\n                    <h3>\r\n                        <a style=3D\"color: orange;text-decoration: underlin=\r\ne;\" href=3D\"https:\/\/vibeadventures.be\/api\/boooking-summary-pdf?tour_id=3D82=\r\n627\">\r\n                            Download itinerary\r\n                        <\/a>\r\n                    <\/h3>\r\n                <\/td>\r\n            <\/tr>\r\n        <\/table>\r\n        <div class=3D\"Borderg\" style=3D\"padding: 1%;\">\r\n            <table width=3D\"100%\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                                        <td style=3D\"width: 80%; vertical-a=\r\nlign: top;\">\r\n                        <h3 class=3D\"Tcolor\">Splendours of Japan (9 Days)<\/=\r\nh3>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            <img style=3D\"width: 16px; height: 16px; vertic=\r\nal-align: middle;\"\r\n                                src=3D\"data:image\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAA=\r\nANSUhEUgAAABAAAAAQCAYAAAAf8\/9hAAAABmJLR0QA\/wD\/AP+gvaeTAAABhElEQVQ4jY3RPWuUU=\r\nRAF4GfW3UAQFE2bw