                   <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <\\/table>\\r\\n        <br>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n        <br>\\r\\n       <div style=3D\\\"text-align: center\\\">\\r\\n        <div>\\r\\n            <a href=3D\\\"https:\\/\\/vibeadventures.be\\/api\\/boooking-summary-pdf?t=\\r\\nour_id=3D124570\\\" style=3D\\\"background-color: orange; padding:2%;color:white;=\\r\\nborder-radius:10px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration: none;\\\">View booking<\\/a=\\r\\n>\\r\\n        <\\/div>\\r\\n        <br>\\r\\n        <div>\\r\\n            <label>If you need help, <a style=3D\\\"color:#82CF45;text-decorat=\\r\\nion:none;\\\" href=3D\\\"https:\\/\\/hopeful-nobel.74-208-189-166.plesk.page\\/contact-=\\r\\nus\\\" >contact us<\\/a><\\/label>\\r\\n        <\\/div>\\r\\n        <\\/div>\\r\\n       <br>\\r\\n       <div style=3D\\\"text-align: justify; border-style: dotted; padding:2%;=\\r\\n border-radius:15px;border-color:#82CF45\\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n                      <div style=3D\\\"page-break-inside: avoid\\\">\\r\\n            <p style=3D\\\"color: gray\\\"> <b>FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS<\\/b> <\\/p=\\r\\n>\\r\\n               <p><b>How do i check in for my flight?<\\/b><\\/p>\\r\\n               <p>You can check in online through the airline's website or =\\r\\nat the airport check-in counter. Make sure to download your e-ticket and co=\\r\\nmplete the process well in advance.<\\/p>\\r\\n           <\\/div>\\r\\n           <div style=3D\\\"page-break-inside: avoid\\\">\\r\\n               <p><b>Where can i find baggage and check-in policies?<\\/b><\\/p=\\r\\n>\\r\\n               <p>Review the conditions outlined by each airline carrier in=\\r\\n your flight summary before your trip. <\\/p>\\r\\n           <\\/div>\\r\\n           <div style=3D\\\"page-break-inside: avoid\\\">\\r\\n               <p><b>Are the accommodations guarented as listed in the tour=\\r\\n description or trip notes?<\\/b><\\/p>\\r\\n               <p>Accommodations are approximate and subject to change base=\\